        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, frame extension, PVC, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, frame extension, PVC, to final disposal
The amount of materials to be disposed of at the end of life was estimated based on the bill of materials.;
UUID: cd53def5-3484-40ea-b998-13c69d6fc144
Included processes are the disposal of PVC, wood, EPS rigid foam and glue. The transport to the municipal incineration plant is included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at frame extenstion manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cd53def5-3484-40ea-b998-13c69d6fc144.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
